    "korean_title": "Nebula v1.5.0 릴리스, rclcpp 의존성 제거",
    "korean_summary": "TIER IV의 센서 드라이버 라이브러리 Nebula v1.5.0이 rclcpp 의존성을 제거하고 로깅 기능을 추가했다."
   },
   "summary_data": null,
   "related": [],
   "uid": "gh:tier4/nebula:v1.5.0",
   "body": "Release Notes This release removes the rclcpp dependency from the decoder libraries and makes Nebula build with the conda-forge toolchain used by RoboStack. What's Changed test: increase nebula_core_common unit coverage by @mojomex in #425 test: cover nebula_robosense_common parser by @mojomex in #428 test: cover nebula_hesai_common helpers by @mojomex in #427 fix(nebula_velodyne_common): report calibration read/write failures by @mojomex in #429 docs: add release guide to documentation by @mojomex in #434 feat(nebula_core_common): add throttled and log-once logging to Logger by @mojomex in #536 build(nebula_core_decoders): declare rcpputils, drop unused sensor_msgs by @mojomex in #529 refactor(nebula_hesai_decoders): remove the rclcpp dependency by @mojomex in #530 refactor(nebula_robosense_decoders): inject a logger instead of using rclcpp by @mojomex in #531 refactor(nebula_velodyne_decoders): inject a logger instead of using rclcpp by @mojomex in #532 refactor(nebula_continental): inject a logger into the SRR520 decoder by @mojomex in #534 fix(nebula_hesai): account for the AT128's three scans per rotation by @mojomex in #527 build(nebula_core_decoders): replace png++ with libpng, declare zlib by @mojomex in #538 fix: build with the conda-forge toolchain (M_PIf, boost/format.hpp) by @mojomex in #545 refactor(nebula_core_common): track log-once call sites in a set by @mojomex in #541 fix(nebula_core_common): reject negative throttle periods in Logger by @mojomex in #542 refactor: name decoder and monitor loggers consistently across vendors by @mojomex in #543 build(nebula_core_decoders): use own thread safety annotations, drop rcpputils by @mojomex in #544 chore: release v1.5.0 by @mojomex in #546 Full Changelog : v1.4.0...v1.5.0"
  }
 ],
